        <div class="tab-content" id="tab-swlist" data-main="software" data-sub="softwarelist">
            <div class="info">
                Every distinct installed program across all devices, with how many carry it and whether it has a
                CVE, a winget update, or a collected license. "Update everywhere" runs the existing winget update
                for that package on every device in scope (it needs a winget id; rows without one cannot).
            </div>
            <div class="controls">
                <input type="text" id="swfFilter" class="filter-input" placeholder="Filter by software or publisher..." style="min-width:260px;">
                <button id="swfRefreshBtn" class="small">Refresh</button>
                <label class="dlselall"><input type="checkbox" id="swfSelectUpdatable"> select updatable</label>
                <span id="swfRunInfo" class="hint"></span>
            </div>
            <div class="table-container">
                <table>
                    <thead><tr>
                        <th style="width:26px;"></th><th style="cursor:default">Software</th>
                        <th style="cursor:default">Version</th><th style="cursor:default">Publisher</th>
                        <th style="width:64px;cursor:default">Devices</th><th style="width:118px;">Vulnerabilities</th>
                        <th style="width:80px;">Update</th><th style="width:66px;">License</th><th style="width:130px;">Actions</th>
                    </tr></thead>
                    <tbody id="swfBody"><tr><td colspan="9" style="color:#888">Loading...</td></tr></tbody>
                </table>
            </div>
            <div class="controls"><button class="green" id="swfUpdateAllBtn">Update the selected packages everywhere</button></div>
            <div id="swfMsg"></div>
        </div>
